<title>USA: CYCOMM GETS $3.2 MLN IN 'PCMOBILE' ORDERS.</title>
<headline>CYCOMM GETS $3.2 MLN IN 'PCMOBILE' ORDERS.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cycomm International Inc said Wednesday that it received $3.2 million worth of orders for its rugged PCMobile laptops and peripherals from various public safety agencies in the United States.</p>
<p>The company said delivery of these orders will be reflected in its third and fourth quarter results.</p>
<p>Cycomm International, a Canadian company, makes a variety of information technology products.</p>
